{{!
    @template tool_vae/dossier_page

    The dossier of a vaeiste under its heading: the error of the core when the competencies are switched off; or the
    coverage, what the vaeiste says is outside their activity, the sentence that there is no declaration yet or the legend
    of the states and a block per declaration, the positionings of the structure, and the buttons.

    Every text comes from the context, drawn by tool_vae\output\dossier_page. The template holds no logic beyond its
    sections. Every key is HTML, placed as it is (triple braces): disabledhtml and nonehtml, notifications of the core (or
    empty); coveragehtml, scopehtml, legendhtml, claimhtml and positioninghtml, drawn by the templates of tool_vae (coverage,
    scope_box, state_legend, dossier_claim, positioning_section), coveragehtml and legendhtml possibly empty; buttonhtml, a
    button of the core.

    Classes required for JS:
    * none

    Data attributes required for JS:
    * none

    Context variables required for this template:
    * disabledhtml - string, HTML: the error of the core, or empty
    * dossier - null, or {coveragehtml, scopehtml, nonehtml, legendhtml, claims, positioninghtml, buttons}: claims each
      {claimhtml}, buttons each {buttonhtml}

    Example context (json):
    {
        "disabledhtml": "",
        "dossier": {
            "coveragehtml": "",
            "scopehtml": "<div class=\"tool-vae-scope\">Nothing said outside the activity.</div>",
            "nonehtml": "",
            "legendhtml": "<details class=\"tool-vae-legend mb-3\"><summary>States</summary></details>",
            "claims": [{"claimhtml": "<section class=\"tool-vae-claim-block mb-4\">RNCP100-C01</section>"}],
            "positioninghtml": "<section class=\"tool-vae-positioning\">Positionings</section>",
            "buttons": [{"buttonhtml": "<div class=\"singlebutton\"><button type=\"submit\">Declare</button></div>"}]
        }
    }
}}
{{{disabledhtml}}}{{#dossier}}{{{coveragehtml}}}{{{scopehtml}}}{{{nonehtml}}}{{{legendhtml}}}{{!
}}{{#claims}}{{{claimhtml}}}{{/claims}}{{{positioninghtml}}}{{#buttons}}{{{buttonhtml}}}{{/buttons}}{{/dossier}}
